# Why alcohols and not hydrocarbons?

@notes

Source: lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 15.

=== layout: one-panel

# Why Alcohol?

@body

- Good\:
  - Can be synthesized biologically or chemically
  - Increased fuel efficiency
- Bad\:
  - lower energy density = less power per gallon
    - ethanol is oxidized form of ethane
- Typically produced from biomass (sugars) through fermentation

@notes

Source: lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 16.

