# Engineered yeast: a 2010 example

@left

- Researchers introduced a fungal cellodextrin transport system into yeast.
- Engineered yeast grew on cellodextrins.
- With cellulose breakdown and fermentation combined, ethanol production improved.

[Galazka et al., 2010](https://pubmed.ncbi.nlm.nih.gov/20829451/)

