=== layout: one-panel

# Types of Biofuels

@body

- *Bio-alcohols* – biologically produced alcohols, most commonly ethanol
- *Bio-diesel* – produced from oils or fats – similar in composition to fossil diesel.
- *Algae fuel* – CO2 and sunlight to produce either ethanol or hydrocarbons.
- *Cellulosic fuels* – cellulose-based fuel – stalks of wheat, corn, and wood converted to ethanol

@notes

Source: lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 52.

