=== layout: one-panel

# Topic 10\: Vaccines

@body

- How are vaccines traditionally made?
- Can foods be used as an edible vaccine?
  - If so, how can this be done?
  - What are the challenges?
- What are the major vaccines available today?

@notes

Source: lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 62.

=== layout: one-panel

# Food-delivered vaccines: questions to test

@body

- Could a food deliver a consistent antigen dose?
- Would the antigen remain active through storage and digestion?
- What immune response would be needed?
- How would safety and effectiveness be evaluated?
- Which practical advantages are targets rather than demonstrated results?

@notes

Source: lect06c-set_4_TP-chapter_12-16_material.odp, slide 63.
