@replaceme

# Dr. Voss on Glyphosate

@body

- I feel like I am a minority voice. But every year, there are dozens of studies that attempt to prove that Round-Up (glyphosate) is the devil.
- So far there haven't been any major findings that it is as bad as the media portrays. At this point, I'm cynical, but I definitely support further research.
- Generally, for industrial crops glyphosate is preferable to other more dangerous herbicides.

@notes

