# Check the product and the production method

@body

- A food category can contain products made by different methods.
- Feeding an animal a GM crop does not make the animal genetically engineered.
- Selective breeding and genetic engineering are different methods.
- Availability depends on country, product, and date.
- Recheck the legacy color-coded answer list before using it.

