# Evaluate the trait and its use

@body

- Food safety: evaluate the specific product and new proteins.
- Gene flow: consider compatible relatives and exposure.
- Biodiversity: examine crop varieties and management.
- Water and herbicides: compare the actual farming systems.
- A single yes/no label cannot answer every question.

